# parley-combat: load saved game A, rest eight hours until kobolds find the party (12:50), advance to the
# attitude menu (A, P), answer NICE (N): the kobolds take it badly and the tactical combat map opens. Quick combat
# (Q) plays the party's turns and the kobolds' for twelve rounds of keys until the game asks to continue the
# battle. Covers combat setup, movement, the attack and damage rules, the monster AI, the combat screen and the
# ECL menus. The camp screen is animated, so its keys are `press`.
clock 12:00:16.58
wheel
wait 20
key L
wait 20
key A
wait 300
key E
wait 100
press R                  # camp: Rest
wait 60
press H                  # rest time: Hours
wait 20
press I                  # Inc, eight times
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press I
wait 20
press R                  # start resting; a monster appears
wait 900
shot encounter
key A
wait 200
key P
wait 200
shot attitudes
key N
wait 400
shot parley
key ENTER
wait 300
shot fight-start
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
key Q
wait 150
shot fight-12
quit
